# PROJECT MANAGER — Roadmap TODO (durable task list)

This file lives in src/ so it persists across sessions (workspace root files are
ephemeral). It is the single source of truth for roadmap progress. Update the
checkboxes as tasks are implemented and validated.

Workflow: implement ONE task at a time, write validation tests, tick it off,
await review, then proceed. All data is local-first (kv-plugin/IndexedDB) —
nothing is ever uploaded to a server. Built on the rathji-template
(https://perchance.org/rathji-template).

Last updated: 2026-08-29

Progress: Phase 1 (1–16) ✓ · Phase 2 (17–21) ✓ · Phase 2b (22–23) ✓ · Phase 3 (24–26) ✓ · Phase 3b (27–30) ✓ · Phase 3c (31) + Phase 4 (32–35) ✓ · Phase 4b–9 (36–73) ✓ · Phase 10 (74–79) ✓ · Phase 11 (80–82) ✓ · 83–85 (Gantt/Today/Portfolio) ✓ · 86–88 (Attachments/Tags/Backups) ✓ · 89–91 (Exports/Weekly report/Quick capture) ✓ · Next: 92–101

